OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start this morning with
OL,6,Fearly mist and fog patches quickly
OL,7,Fclearing. Otherwise, a dry and fine
OL,8,Fday today with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine with
OL,10,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining dry and fine
OL,13,Fovernight with lengthy clear skies. A
OL,14,Ffew mist and fog patches forming under
OL,15,Fthe clear skies, with temperatures
OL,16,Ffalling into single figures in rural
OL,17,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
