OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,6,Fsunny spells, especially in the west.
OL,7,FEastern areas may see cloud
OL,8,Foccasionally move in from the North
OL,9,FSea, with the odd spot of rain
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,13,Fat first on Tuesday, with showers
OL,14,Flikely developing later. Unsettled
OL,15,Fmidweek, with a risk of heavy rain and
OL,16,Fthunderstorms. A little warmer and
OL,17,Fmore humid for a time.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
